  "text": "About us\nProjects\nTeam\nCompetitions\nSponsor us\nJoin Marinor\nMARINOR NTNU · PARTNERSHIPS\nOPEN FOR PARTNERS\nBecome our next partner.\n\nWe are looking for new sponsors and partners. If your company wants to support us, contact our Head of Sponsorship and Branding.\n\nContact us\nWhy partner with us\nGET IN TOUCH\nHead of Sponsorship and Branding\nandreas.furst@marinorntnu.no\nCopy email\n\nWe want to work with companies that care about new technology and want to help students build it.\n\n2025\nfounded at NTNU in Trondheim\n35+\nmembers from robotics, automation and marine technology\n7\ngroups – from perception and control to hardware and PR\n23\nteams in the 2026 Njord Challenge – we were one of them\nWHY PARTNER WITH MARINOR\nWhat you get as a partner.\n\nThis is what a partnership gives you.\n\n01\nReach future engineers\n\nReach engaged and highly qualified future engineers from NTNU.\n\n02\nShape us from the ground up\n\nHelp shape and develop Marinor as a student organization from the ground up.\n\n03\nBack new technology\n\nSupport the development of new technology and student-driven innovation.\n\n04\nWork on real projects\n\nParticipate in professionally relevant projects and collaborations.\n\n05\nPositive brand exposure\n\nGain positive brand exposure through Marinor's activities and competition participation.\n\nWHAT YOU SUPPORT\nWhat your support pays for.\n\nMaterials, electronics, sensors and travel to competitions. Here is some of the work.\n\n01\nShaping the first hull\n02\nSanding and finishing\n03\nFirst float test\n04\nWiring on the dock\n05\nSensors on board\n06\nTesting in the harbour\n07\nArgus on the water\n08\nThe team behind it\nHOW IT WORKS\nThree steps to a partnership.\n01\nSend us an email\n\nTell us a little about your company and what you are interested in.\n\n02\nWe find the right fit\n\nWe meet, talk about goals on both sides and agree on what the partnership looks like.\n\n03\nBuild it together\n\nFollow the project from the workshop to the water – and to the competitions.\n\nOUR SPONSORS\nThanks to our partners.\n\nThese companies and organisations support Marinor NTNU. Without them we could not build our boats or travel to competitions.\n\nGOLD PARTNER\nSILVER PARTNERS\nBRONZE PARTNERS\nLET'S TALK\nGet in touch.\n\nSend us an email and we will answer. We can tell you more about Marinor and what a partnership could look like.\n\nandreas.furst@marinorntnu.no\nCopy email\n\nA student organisation at NTNU in Trondheim that builds autonomous boats.\n\nmarinorntnu@gmail.com\nCopy\nHøgskoleringen 1\n7034 Trondheim\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nMARINOR\nHome\nAbout us\nTeam\nCompetitions\nOUR WORK\nArgus\nProteus\nNjord Challenge\nRoboBoat\nGET INVOLVED\nJoin the crew\nSponsor us\nEmail us\n© 2026 Marinor NTNU\nOrg.nr. 936 064 809\nBack to top",
